---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How eduAssets handles personal data and browsing information." locale="en" path="privacy-policy">
  <main class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated: October 20, 2026.</p>
    <h2>Scope</h2><p>This policy applies to the eduAssets institutional website. The application at app.eduassets.tech must provide its own policy before collecting user data.</p>
    <h2>Data collection</h2><p>This landing page has no forms, log-in, analytics or advertising and does not collect personal data directly. It stores only the visitor’s theme preference locally.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or to exercise data-protection rights, use the e-mail address in the website footer.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/">Back to the website</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

